  "description": "“Can a human trust another human? To trust is to gamble. Then where should I bet?” The notorious mafia “Sambuca” abducts children and produces drugs. To fight against them, Mi-Ho Won, the heir of one of the wealthiest families in Korea, recruits immortal girl Suk-Ui Kang and former mafia member Lilia to form “The QUEENS.” Will The QUEENS be able to win the war against Sambuca? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
